# OmniMCP Cursor Rules (v6.8.5)

- Prefer progressive discovery (`discover_server` -> `discover_tools` -> `get_tool_schema` -> `invoke_tool` with `_projection`).
- For multi-step workflows, call `get_codemode_types` with `intent` and execute sandboxed scripts via `codemode` using `codemode.<service>.<tool>(args)` (never `omni.<service>.<tool>`).
- Never embed literal Bearer tokens or secrets in MCP configuration files; reference environment variables (`${OMNI_AUTH_TOKEN}`).
